      "allowedDiffPixels": 277,
      "allowedDiffReason": "Icon edges only: each tab centres icon + label (77.4px) in 120px, so the icons sit at fractional x (57.78 / 173.53 / 297.55). Figma draws them there; Chrome paints replaced elements at the rounded x (verified: shifting each icon by x \u2212 round(x) gives 0 drift). Not corrected in code because other engines snap differently."
